    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a fundamental part of my life. From solving complex problems to understanding patterns in nature and society, math provides clarity and precision. I appreciate its logical structure and the way it helps us make sense of the world around us.",
    "Do you ever get anxious when thinking about mathematics?": "Yes, there were times during my studies when I felt overwhelmed by the complexity of certain topics. The pressure to perform well in exams and the fear of not understanding deeply enough sometimes caused anxiety. However, with practice and support, this anxiety has diminished over time.",
